---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro"
---

<Layout title="About" description="About Mini Arcade, Luis Marrero’s home for small browser game experiments.">
    <header class="shell page-intro about-intro">
        <div>
            <span class="eyebrow">About Mini Arcade</span>
            <h1 class="display-type">I make small games to learn how things work.</h1>
        </div>
        <p>
            This is the shelf where I keep them: course projects, weekend experiments,
            half-finished ideas and the ones that became fun enough to share.
        </p>
    </header>

    <article class="shell about-grid">
        <aside class="cabinet-note">
            <div class="cabinet-note__lights" aria-hidden="true">
                <span></span><span></span><span></span>
            </div>
            <p>
                There is no grand release plan. I add a game when an experiment
                gives me something worth keeping.
            </p>
        </aside>

        <div class="about-copy">
            <section>
                <h2>Why this exists</h2>
                <p>
                    Games are a good excuse to learn. They make state, interaction,
                    animation and all the awkward edge cases visible very quickly.
                    Mini Arcade gives those exercises a permanent home instead of
                    leaving them scattered across old folders.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>What it is made with</h2>
                <p>
                    Astro holds the site together. React and TypeScript handle most
                    of the game logic, and CSS gives each game room to have its own
                    personality. The stack changes when an experiment needs it.
                </p>
                <ul class="tool-list" aria-label="Technology used">
                    <li>Astro</li>
                    <li>React</li>
                    <li>TypeScript</li>
                    <li>CSS</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2>Who is behind it</h2>
                <p>
                    I’m Luis Marrero, a developer who likes learning by building.
                    The project is open source, including the unfinished parts.
                </p>
                <div class="about-actions">
                    <a href="https://github.com/luismarrer/mini-arcade" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button">View the source ↗</a>
                    <a href="https://luismarrer.github.io/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button button--secondary">My portfolio ↗</a>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </article>
</Layout>

<style>
    .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(13rem, 0.55fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
        gap: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
        max-width: 980px;
        padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    }

    .about-intro h1 {
        max-width: 760px;
        font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 6vw, 4.6rem);
    }

    .cabinet-note {
        position: sticky;
        top: 2rem;
        height: fit-content;
        padding: 1.15rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--arcade-border);
        border-top-color: var(--arcade-purple-bright);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        background: rgba(33, 23, 46, 0.7);
    }

    .cabinet-note__lights {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.35rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .cabinet-note__lights span {
        width: 0.48rem;
        height: 0.48rem;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--arcade-red);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(229, 69, 75, 0.4);
    }

    .cabinet-note__lights span:nth-child(2) { background: var(--arcade-yellow); }
    .cabinet-note__lights span:nth-child(3) { background: var(--arcade-green); }

    .cabinet-note p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--arcade-muted);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .about-copy {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .about-copy section {
        padding-block: 0.25rem 2.4rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--arcade-border);
    }

    .about-copy section + section { padding-top: 2.4rem; }

    .about-copy h2 {
        margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--arcade-text);
        font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    }

    .about-copy p {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: var(--arcade-muted);
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .tool-list {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.6rem;
        margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
    }

    .tool-list li {
        padding: 0.45rem 0.8rem;
        border: 1px solid var(--arcade-border-bright);
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: var(--arcade-muted);
        background: var(--arcade-surface);
        font-family: var(--font-utility);
        font-size: 0.68rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .about-actions {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.7rem;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
        .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .cabinet-note { position: static; }
    }
</style>
